  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Changed\n- Optimized `GetWindowMedian` to sort in-place, reducing memory pressure and GC overhead.  \n- Removed internal MessageBox calls from the library; now exceptions are thrown only to maintain UI independence.  \n- Clarified `kernelWidth` wording and aligned CSV / Excel header documentation and progress reporting.  \n- Removed internal MessageBox calls from the library and now throw exceptions only to maintain UI independence.\n\nAdded\n- Configurable `BoundaryMode` (Symmetric, Replicate, ZeroPad, Adaptive) applied to `AllMedian`; selected mode is recorded in CSV headers and displayed in Excel headers (default : Symmetric).  \n- BoundaryMode support in README, examples, and API (tickets and services).  \n- MessageBox on Excel interop failure (with option to open Microsoft Office download page) and a generic error dialog; no changes outside .NET Framework 4.8.  \n- Added `running-median` tag to NuGet package metadata for improved discoverability.  \n\nExtended\n- Extended APIs (`SignatureMedian` overloads, CSV / ExcelOrderTickets and services) to accept and propagate BoundaryMode with backward-compatible defaults.",
